g: Results From a Prospective Trial. <i>Clinical pharmacology and therapeutics 108(2):264–273</i>. DOI:<a href=\"https://doi.org/10.1002/cpt.1715\">10.1002/cpt.1715</a> PUBMED:<a href=\"https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/31701524\">31701524</a></p></li></ol></body></html>", revisions = "<html><body><ul><li>11/2026 generated by pharmacolibrary-dev export.pharmacolibrary_models from Chiesa_2020: parameters extracted from the paper by the pharmacolibrary-dev pipeline, model built by its engineer, reviewed: accepted with caveats</li></ul></body></html>"),
